{"id":"tonne","lemma":"tonne","pos":"noun","rank":2653,"glosses":["large barrel","tonne, metric ton","ton"],"ipa":"/tɔn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7a/Fr-tonne.ogg/Fr-tonne.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tonnes"},"formAudio":{"tonnes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/12/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-tonnes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Vous avez des tonnes d'amis.","en":"You have lots of friends.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"friend","l":"ami"}]},{"text":"J'ai une tonne de devoirs.","en":"I've got a ton of homework.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"homework"}]},{"text":"Je connais des tonnes de blagues.","en":"I know tons of jokes.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"joke","l":"blague"}]},{"text":"J'ai des tonnes d'idées.","en":"I've got tons of ideas.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"idea","l":"idée"}]},{"text":"Il y avait sur lui une tonne de pression.","en":"There was a ton of pressure on him.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"pressure"}]}]}